{"4915830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sanguine Thread", "steam_appid": 4915830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A perfect crime? That’s what they thought.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plunge into the darkness of *Sanguine Thread*, an immersive, psychological black-and-white investigative thriller. As a private detective with a troubled past, you’ll have to unravel a case that’s far darker than it seems. Pull the threads of a conspiracy that no one was supposed to follow… at the risk of getting tangled up in it yourself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An interactive 3D investigation: Explore highly detailed closed environments powered by Unreal Engine 5. Search every piece of furniture, open drawers, and leave no corner in the shadows.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4915830/extras/0a59c80146373777fb419a0faa61cadf.poster.avif?t=1784230660\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4915830/extras/0a59c80146373777fb419a0faa61cadf.webm?t=1784230660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4915830/extras/0a59c80146373777fb419a0faa61cadf.mp4?t=1784230660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Examine every detail: Manipulate and examine 3D clues from every angle. A revolver, an old Zippo lighter… a real cop knows that the truth is always hidden beneath the surface.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4915830/extras/ec3bfba3b73f135234dfc9fa65b5ad08.webp?t=1784230660\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4915830/extras/ec3bfba3b73f135234dfc9fa65b5ad08.poster.avif?t=1784230660\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Deduction Board: Connect your evidence, notes, and suspects on your corkboard using the traditional red string. It’s up to you to piece together the clues to uncover the truth. No outside help—your logic is your only weapon.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4915830/extras/5b86a9ad0df7a468eb3c8bb69de6c509.poster.avif?t=1784230660\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4915830/extras/5b86a9ad0df7a468eb3c8bb69de6c509.mp4?t=1784230660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Radical Film Noir Atmosphere: Immerse yourself in a high-contrast two-tone aesthetic, enhanced by breathtaking lighting and a high-tension jazz/crime soundtrack.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A perfect crime? That’s what they thought.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plunge into the darkness of *Sanguine Thread*, an immersive, psychological black-and-white investigative thriller. As a private detective with a troubled past, you’ll have to unravel a case that’s far darker than it seems. Pull the threads of a conspiracy that no one was supposed to follow… at the risk of getting tangled up in it yourself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An interactive 3D investigation: Explore highly detailed closed environments powered by Unreal Engine 5. Search every piece of furniture, open drawers, and leave no corner in the shadows.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4915830/extras/0a59c80146373777fb419a0faa61cadf.poster.avif?t=1784230660\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4915830/extras/0a59c80146373777fb419a0faa61cadf.webm?t=1784230660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4915830/extras/0a59c80146373777fb419a0faa61cadf.mp4?t=1784230660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Examine every detail: Manipulate and examine 3D clues from every angle. A revolver, an old Zippo lighter… a real cop knows that the truth is always hidden beneath the surface.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4915830/extras/ec3bfba3b73f135234dfc9fa65b5ad08.webp?t=1784230660\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4915830/extras/ec3bfba3b73f135234dfc9fa65b5ad08.poster.avif?t=1784230660\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Deduction Board: Connect your evidence, notes, and suspects on your corkboard using the traditional red string. It’s up to you to piece together the clues to uncover the truth. No outside help—your logic is your only weapon.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4915830/extras/5b86a9ad0df7a468eb3c8bb69de6c509.poster.avif?t=1784230660\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4915830/extras/5b86a9ad0df7a468eb3c8bb69de6c509.mp4?t=1784230660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Radical Film Noir Atmosphere: Immerse yourself in a high-contrast two-tone aesthetic, enhanced by breathtaking lighting and a high-tension jazz/crime soundtrack.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A 3D psychological detective thriller in a radical film noir style. Explore immersive environments, examine clues from every angle, and connect your evidence on a deduction board to solve a dark conspiracy. Use your pure logic to untangle the truth.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4915830/358b9ef7e2188f41e53f64ee6c942d4cfc02fe25/header.jpg?t=1784230660", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4915830/4c395651ec7c07aa061d82cf52788551590fca0f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784230660", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4915830/4c395651ec7c07aa061d82cf52788551590fca0f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784230660", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 Ti / AMD Radeon RX 570<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Pouet Games"], "publishers": ["Pouet Games"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id":